          <td valign=top>
            <a name="DESC">
            Do you ever wonder how those people go from level 1 to 50+ in a matter of days? Or even a day?  Or are you busy and would you like to be able to solo from level 1 to 65 with any class at your leisure?  If you’ve answered yes to either of the previous questions then you would benefit greatly from bidding on this auction.<br><p>
This auction is for a level 61 druid; the quintessential power leveling class of everquest.  You might be wondering; there are level 65 druids for sell, why should I not simply pay more and buy one of them?  The simple answer is that for leveling characters from level 1 to 46 a level 61 druid can do everything a level 65 druid can do to power level.  Not to mention it will be lighter on the wallet.  <br><p>
I can guarantee that with this account you will be able to power level characters from 1 to 50 in a matter of days.  If you play hard core perhaps even in a day.  <br><p>
Never used a druid to powerlevel?  It’s simple.  I’ve power leveled countless characters from 1 to 50+ and will tell you exactly how to do it and the best places to go for power leveling 1 to 50+.  I’ll even log on an alternate account and show you personally the exact location in each zone if need be.<br><p>
Only have one computer?  It’s quite simple to play everquest in windows.  If you don’t already know I’ll explain how to do it after the auction.  <br><p>
Anymore questions you have I’ll be sure to answer; simply ask.<br><p>
Now, about the account itself.  As previously mentioned there is a level 61 druid on the account with about 12 AA points.  The druid is well equipped with over 255 wisdom and the nature walkers scimitar and nearly all no drop armor from planes and what not.
There is also a twinked level 48 rogue on the account.  The rogue is equipped with all kael armor except boots and two very impressive daggers.<br><p>

I will also entertain trades for Lineage 2 adena; email me offers.  I accept payment only via paypal.<br><p>
